  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/graph2/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 100b6fbb6e. sketch.py ~:3693 still tests `any(fnmatch(p, pat) for p in item.parts ...)` on absolute paths. Direct call of _collect_important_files: the fixture at <batch>/fx_dizad3 returns ['onlydocs/guide.md'], and the same tree under <batch>/.cache/ returns []. Stale part: build/dist/vendor/out/target were removed from DEFAULT_EXCLUDES (b89cc2e5a2, 2026-10-12), so a repo under */build/* now works (verified: same result as the control). At small fixture size the end-to-end sketch output did not differ. MECHANISM: exclude patterns tested against item.parts of absolute paths instead of parts relative to repo_root. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-gimis."  # 2f25
